{"id":"million","lemma":"миллион","pos":"num","rank":994,"glosses":["million (1,000,000)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f1/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD.ogg/Ru-%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я видел это миллион раз.","en":"I've seen it a million times.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Том хотел миллион долларов.","en":"Tom wanted a million dollars.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,null]},{"text":"Оказалось, что мы получили миллион долларов.","en":"It turned out that we received a million dollars.","words":[{"g":"to turn out","l":"оказаться"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to receive, to get","l":"получить"},null,null]},{"text":"Это вопрос на миллион долларов.","en":"That's the million-dollar question.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"question"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null]},{"text":"Я уже миллион раз тебе это говорил.","en":"I've already told you that a million times.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"already"},null,{"g":"time"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]}]}